    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1026">

                <pb facs="0774" n="658" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg658"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 125.29781/39.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Special Agent Carothers
                        to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">El Paso</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-04-07">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 7, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your telegram regarding Consular Agent, Parral. I have just interviewed Carranza
                    and he was very indignant. Promised immediate attention. He concurs with you
                    regarding fiat money. He will have reply from Parral tomorrow.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">G. C. Carothers</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
